ill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-2&-3&-5\\\\2&1&2\\\\1&1&-2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(4-6-10\\bigr)-\\bigl(-5-4+12\\bigr)\\]\\[=-15\\neq0\\]<div class='res'>Las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Un punto genérico de \\(s\\) es \\(C(2+\\lambda,\\lambda,1-2\\lambda)\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{CA}=(2-\\lambda,\\ 3-\\lambda,\\ 5+2\\lambda)\\qquad\\overrightarrow{CB}=(-4-\\lambda,\\ -\\lambda,\\ -1+2\\lambda)\\]<p>Son ortogonales si su producto escalar es 0:</p>\\[(2-\\lambda)(-4-\\lambda)+(3-\\lambda)(-\\lambda)+(5+2\\lambda)(-1+2\\lambda)=0\\]\\[6\\lambda^2+7\\lambda-13=0\\iff\\lambda=\\frac{-7\\pm\\sqrt{49+312}}{12}=\\frac{-7\\pm19}{12}\\]\\[\\lambda=1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ C_1(3,1,-1)\\qquad\\lambda=-\\frac{13}6\\ \\Rightarrow\\ C_2\\left(-\\frac16,-\\frac{13}6,\\frac{16}3\\right)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-15,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-2.8,-0.4,-0.8],[4.8,3.4,6.8],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4.8,3.4,6.8],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-1.0,-3.0,7.0],[3.6,1.6,-2.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.6,1.6,-2.2],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.4,1.2,2.4],[1.26